; logic.batt - Demonstrates comparison and logical operators

; Comparison operators
"5 >= 3 = " print 5 3 >= println
"3 >= 5 = " print 3 5 >= println
"5 >= 5 = " print 5 5 >= println

"3 <= 5 = " print 3 5 <= println
"5 <= 3 = " print 5 3 <= println

"3 != 5 = " print 3 5 != println
"5 != 5 = " print 5 5 != println

; Logical operators
"1 and 1 = " print 1 1 and println
"1 and 0 = " print 1 0 and println
"0 or 1 = " print 0 1 or println
"0 or 0 = " print 0 0 or println

; Combined: is 7 between 1 and 10?
"7 is between 1 and 10: " print
7 1 >= 7 10 <= and println
